  "details": "# Issue:\nThe pop-up for when you are already wearing an Avatar in the Avatars Menu says \"You are already wearing the Avatar\" while the button in the Avatar Details says \"You are already using the Avatar\". This is inconsistent.\n# Suggestion:\nThe pop-up in both Menus should be the same. I would recommend using \"You are already wearing the Avatar\" for both.\n# Attachments:\nThe first picture you can see the pop-up in the Avatars Tab and in the second one in the Avatar Details:",
